WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:36.707
Master, where did this blizzard come from?

2
00:00:38.416 --> 00:00:40.707
Don't believe everything you see!

3
00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:44.582
But I really feel cold!

4
00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:47.457
then you're already under her spell

5
00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:49.290
I've lost without fighting?

6
00:00:58.625 --> 00:00:59.332
The ice harpy!

7
00:00:59.625 --> 00:01:00.582
Wait!

8
00:01:06.916 --> 00:01:08.290
You're no match for her

9
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.832
Now you tell me!

10
00:01:11.666 --> 00:01:13.957
You have come so far to find me

11
00:01:14.791 --> 00:01:17.290
Are you not entranced by my charms?

12
00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:19.624
Instead of meditating on your sins...

13
00:01:19.958 --> 00:01:21.415
...you are still harming humans!

14
00:01:21.916 --> 00:01:25.665
Blame those men, not me!

15
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.374
I was so good to each one of them

16
00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:32.499
But their roving eyes strayed away from me

17
00:01:34.208 --> 00:01:35.999
So they deserved it!

18
00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:37.957
You're an enchantress, they were humans

19
00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:39.874
You were never meant to be together

20
00:01:40.458 --> 00:01:41.665
Today I'll bring it to an end

21
00:01:44.166 --> 00:01:48.124
Monk, you think you can escape from my spell?

22
00:01:48.833 --> 00:01:49.999
then come and get me!

23
00:02:59.291 --> 00:03:00.582
Master, have you killed her?

24
00:03:00.958 --> 00:03:01.957
I've trapped her

25
00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:03.957
Confine her in the Lei Feng Pagoda

26
00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:05.582
Me again?

27
00:03:05.791 --> 00:03:06.707
It's me!

28
00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:29.249
"Jin Shan Temple"

29
00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:38.457
"Lei Feng Pagoda"

30
00:03:50.458 --> 00:03:51.415
Trying to scare me?

31
00:03:51.833 --> 00:03:54.457
Master wouldn't have trapped you
if you were really scary

32
00:03:58.625 --> 00:04:02.082
We're giving you another chance

33
00:04:02.583 --> 00:04:05.124
A chance to reflect and improve

34
00:04:05.625 --> 00:04:07.124
if you make real progress in meditation...

35
00:04:07.458 --> 00:04:09.290
...you'll be released

36
00:04:11.166 --> 00:04:13.790
You, too! Study to improve yourself!

37
00:06:28.791 --> 00:06:32.082
Hey! Hurry up back there!

38
00:06:32.583 --> 00:06:34.124
Coming!

39
00:06:46.958 --> 00:06:47.749
Xu Xian...

40
00:06:48.083 --> 00:06:50.499
I shouldn't have climbed up here
to pick herbs with you

41
00:06:51.291 --> 00:06:52.165
Be a bit more patient

42
00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.165
Look! Here's one!

43
00:06:55.458 --> 00:06:58.582
Unlike Shennong, you know the value of herbs

44
00:06:58.666 --> 00:06:59.999
Xu Xian, you even know which flowers to eat

45
00:07:01.125 --> 00:07:02.290
Which flowers cure which ailments

46
00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.290
Do you even know what flower that is?

47
00:07:04.458 --> 00:07:07.999
That fool is eating flowers! They have thorns!

48
00:07:09.833 --> 00:07:11.207
He's no fool

49
00:07:11.791 --> 00:07:13.957
He's not picking the pretty wild roses
with their thorns

50
00:07:14.208 --> 00:07:15.707
Roses are pretty...

51
00:07:16.375 --> 00:07:18.499
But not as pretty as me

52
00:07:21.666 --> 00:07:24.499
You... you're more like a hornflower

53
00:07:24.958 --> 00:07:27.832
Blowing your own horn from dawn to dusk

54
00:07:30.458 --> 00:07:31.374
Hey, don't you even know...

55
00:07:31.625 --> 00:07:33.665
Medicines cure some ailments

56
00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:36.874
But others need liquor distilled from flowers!

57
00:07:37.041 --> 00:07:40.040
That's absolutely right!

58
00:07:40.708 --> 00:07:41.540
Let's keep going

59
00:07:41.875 --> 00:07:43.832
- Alright
- Climb further?

60
00:07:48.083 --> 00:07:50.540
Look, they're still digging for herbs

61
00:07:51.041 --> 00:07:52.874
They'll strip the whole mountain bare!

62
00:07:54.875 --> 00:07:56.082
I'll give them a scare!

63
00:07:57.541 --> 00:07:58.707
What? Qingqing...

64
00:08:11.041 --> 00:08:14.040
Xu Xian? Xu Xian?

65
00:09:58.500 --> 00:09:59.374
He's coming to

66
00:09:59.458 --> 00:10:00.999
Xu Xian, are you alright?

67
00:10:01.708 --> 00:10:07.707
Xu Xian!

68
00:10:08.458 --> 00:10:09.165
Where's that girl?

69
00:10:09.791 --> 00:10:10.707
What girl?

70
00:10:10.791 --> 00:10:11.999
Maybe you banged your head too hard...

71
00:10:12.166 --> 00:10:13.957
Just now, in the water, a girl kissed me

72
00:10:14.041 --> 00:10:14.874
She breathed into my mouth

73
00:10:15.125 --> 00:10:16.290
She saved me

74
00:10:18.458 --> 00:10:21.540
Hey! The one giving you the kiss of life was me!

75
00:10:29.041 --> 00:10:31.040
Why did you save him?

76
00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:35.040
You even gave his vital energy a boost!

77
00:10:37.875 --> 00:10:42.040
Hey, I'm talking to you! What are you staring at?

78
00:10:44.333 --> 00:10:45.332
Nothing

79
00:10:46.916 --> 00:10:49.082
Nothing? You're smitten!

80
00:11:03.708 --> 00:11:06.040
Master, it looks like another bat-demon bite

81
00:11:07.083 --> 00:11:08.540
Amitabha...

82
00:11:09.958 --> 00:11:10.582
Today is the 1 5th...

83
00:11:10.875 --> 00:11:12.790
The day of the Lantern Festival

84
00:11:14.208 --> 00:11:15.582
We have to find these demons soon

85
00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:17.207
Or many more people will die

86
00:11:18.375 --> 00:11:19.374
Amitabha...

87
00:11:29.083 --> 00:11:30.415
Ferryman, wait!

88
00:11:30.583 --> 00:11:31.582
Here!

89
00:11:31.958 --> 00:11:33.874
We need to cross the river, ferryman

90
00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:38.082
I'm no ferryman, but jump in

91
00:11:38.625 --> 00:11:39.874
I hope we're not delaying you

92
00:11:40.125 --> 00:11:42.082
Not at all! To help others...

93
00:11:42.375 --> 00:11:43.707
...is to spend time well

94
00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:46.290
Thank you, kind sir

95
00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:52.165
Sir...

96
00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:53.957
What you just said was very interesting

97
00:11:54.125 --> 00:11:56.665
How do you use your time
when you're not helping others?

98
00:11:58.791 --> 00:11:59.790
I'm aiming to become...

99
00:12:00.333 --> 00:12:01.290
...a doctor of medicine

100
00:12:01.666 --> 00:12:03.499
Good, good! Young men like us should have dreams!

101
00:12:03.625 --> 00:12:04.165
I have one too

102
00:12:04.625 --> 00:12:07.499
I dream of become the Abbot of Jinshan Temple

103
00:12:08.625 --> 00:12:09.499
And where would that leave me?

104
00:12:10.083 --> 00:12:12.290
Uh, Master... that's not...

105
00:12:12.625 --> 00:12:13.957
I didn't mean now...

106
00:12:13.958 --> 00:12:14.415
I mean, after...

107
00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.499
After my death?

108
00:12:15.791 --> 00:12:16.957
You want me to die?

109
00:12:17.291 --> 00:12:18.415
No, I... I...

110
00:12:18.583 --> 00:12:19.999
That's not what I meant, Master... I...

111
00:12:20.458 --> 00:12:23.499
It seems you are Abbot Fahai of Jinshan Temple

112
00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:25.499
It takes ten years of good deeds
for two people to meet

113
00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:27.915
It's destiny that let us to be acquainted

114
00:12:28.333 --> 00:12:30.457
Young man, you're from Hangzhou?

115
00:12:30.791 --> 00:12:33.040
Yes, my name's Xu Xian

116
00:12:33.333 --> 00:12:34.457
I'm a herbalist

117
00:12:37.291 --> 00:12:38.874
Master, what are you counting?

118
00:12:39.958 --> 00:12:41.165
How long until I die

119
00:12:42.166 --> 00:12:43.999
Xu Xian, the weather's nice today!

120
00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:45.540
That it is

121
00:12:45.791 --> 00:12:46.874
Don't change the subject

122
00:12:47.458 --> 00:12:48.374
What was your dream again?

123
00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:49.165
No...

124
00:12:49.666 --> 00:12:50.665
The ultimate dream

125
00:12:51.041 --> 00:12:51.999
I don't have any dream!

126
00:12:52.041 --> 00:12:53.332
My only dream is my wish that you...

127
00:13:29.583 --> 00:13:32.915
White, tell us what's bothering you

128
00:13:33.208 --> 00:13:35.207
Turtle and I can help you resolve it

129
00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:39.665
What... do... you...

130
00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.332
I want to visit the human world

131
00:13:41.875 --> 00:13:45.874
You just want to see that flower-eating fool!

132
00:13:46.583 --> 00:13:48.040
I'd just like to take another look at him

133
00:13:48.708 --> 00:13:52.040
Look at what? He's just a common mortal!

134
00:13:52.208 --> 00:13:53.999
You've been moping over him for days!

135
00:13:55.208 --> 00:13:56.624
What's this all about?

136
00:13:57.375 --> 00:14:00.082
She used her vital essence
to save a fool who was drowning

137
00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:03.540
if... your... lips...

138
00:14:03.625 --> 00:14:04.624
Let me say it

139
00:14:04.958 --> 00:14:07.249
if their lips met...

140
00:14:07.458 --> 00:14:08.582
...there was a flow of vital essences

141
00:14:08.916 --> 00:14:12.082
He's in you and you're in him!

142
00:14:13.916 --> 00:14:17.249
Nothing so serious,
I just want to take a look at him

143
00:14:18.083 --> 00:14:19.082
Don't give me a hard time

144
00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:20.749
Qingqing, come with me!

145
00:14:20.875 --> 00:14:21.749
Hey, where are you going?

146
00:14:21.875 --> 00:14:23.624
I want to come! Take me too!

147
00:14:23.708 --> 00:14:26.749
I will just stay here

148
00:14:39.458 --> 00:14:41.499
See how much fun the mortal world is?

149
00:14:42.833 --> 00:14:44.999
In a moment, get off the boat...

150
00:14:45.125 --> 00:14:46.290
...and find him for me

151
00:14:47.458 --> 00:14:48.749
I'll be strolling around here

152
00:14:48.791 --> 00:14:51.124
When you find him,
bring him to the pavilion on the lake

153
00:14:51.625 --> 00:14:53.457
Why don't you find him yourself?

154
00:14:54.291 --> 00:14:56.582
I want to play a little joke on him

155
00:14:57.125 --> 00:14:59.124
And see how nice he is

156
00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:06.790
Master, it's turning!

157
00:15:07.125 --> 00:15:08.332
then don't blow on it!

158
00:15:09.083 --> 00:15:10.290
We'll split up to look around

159
00:15:11.583 --> 00:15:12.457
Ah!

160
00:15:26.291 --> 00:15:27.332
Watch out!

161
00:15:28.208 --> 00:15:28.874
What is it?

162
00:15:29.375 --> 00:15:30.332
A demon!

163
00:15:31.666 --> 00:15:34.290
A demon? How do you know?

164
00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:36.874
I'm an expert, of course I know

165
00:15:39.333 --> 00:15:41.540
Are you going to exorcise it?

166
00:15:41.666 --> 00:15:44.999
Shh, not so loud! It's nearby!

167
00:15:46.458 --> 00:15:47.707
My Master and I have been tracking it for ages

168
00:15:47.833 --> 00:15:49.707
Master says we must exorcise it today

169
00:15:50.958 --> 00:15:52.624
Why do you have to do that?

170
00:15:52.833 --> 00:15:53.874
Demons hurt people

171
00:15:54.333 --> 00:15:56.832
What about demons which don't hurt people?

172
00:15:59.291 --> 00:16:00.332
I don't know

173
00:16:00.708 --> 00:16:02.040
Could you make friends with them?

174
00:16:02.083 --> 00:16:02.999
Definitely not!

175
00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:04.207
Why not?

176
00:16:04.708 --> 00:16:07.582
Master only taught me how to exorcise them

177
00:16:08.375 --> 00:16:10.415
Not how to make friends with them

178
00:16:12.208 --> 00:16:13.874
then your Master has a problem

179
00:16:14.208 --> 00:16:16.874
Or maybe his Master had a problem

180
00:16:19.916 --> 00:16:22.832
Why don't I have a problem?

181
00:16:24.833 --> 00:16:27.540
Because you absolutely don't have one

182
00:16:30.041 --> 00:16:30.999
You're very nice

183
00:16:31.375 --> 00:16:32.707
And very smart

184
00:16:33.166 --> 00:16:34.540
I'd like to have a friend like you

185
00:16:35.375 --> 00:16:36.499
I'm Qingqing

186
00:16:44.208 --> 00:16:45.249
I'm Neng Ren

187
00:16:46.916 --> 00:16:48.749
I'm busy, I have to go

188
00:16:50.791 --> 00:16:52.082
Take care!

189
00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:15.832
You are the gentleman my sister wants to see

190
00:17:16.833 --> 00:17:18.790
Look again, do I look like a gentleman?

191
00:17:19.458 --> 00:17:20.624
You have the wrong man

192
00:17:21.666 --> 00:17:22.957
Can't be...

193
00:17:26.208 --> 00:17:28.207
You're a herb-picker, aren't you?

194
00:17:28.708 --> 00:17:31.165
Yes, but I'm not a gentleman

195
00:17:32.458 --> 00:17:34.457
So I can't possibly be the one
your sister wants to see

196
00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:42.082
I recognize you, you're the man who eats flowers

197
00:17:42.541 --> 00:17:43.707
then what's my name?

198
00:17:44.833 --> 00:17:45.624
Who am I?

199
00:17:48.458 --> 00:17:50.040
I don't know

200
00:17:50.958 --> 00:17:53.999
But you are the one my sister wants to see

201
00:17:54.833 --> 00:17:58.082
It's Lantern Festival night, go and enjoy it

202
00:17:59.375 --> 00:18:00.540
And stop bothering me

203
00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:03.040
Goodnight... young miss

204
00:18:08.208 --> 00:18:09.999
What on earth?

205
00:18:20.125 --> 00:18:23.999
Why's it moving?

206
00:18:44.083 --> 00:18:45.915
Stop!

207
00:19:30.208 --> 00:19:31.332
You're a real fool

208
00:19:31.833 --> 00:19:34.124
Where do you think you're going?

209
00:19:57.333 --> 00:19:58.457
Sorry! Sorry!

210
00:19:58.583 --> 00:19:59.582
I didn't do that on purpose!

211
00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:01.624
Sit down

212
00:20:02.875 --> 00:20:05.374
Miss, it's late and you're here alone

213
00:20:05.833 --> 00:20:07.124
This isn't proper

214
00:20:08.458 --> 00:20:10.082
Don't treat me as a stranger

215
00:20:10.666 --> 00:20:11.999
You don't need to be so polite

216
00:20:13.458 --> 00:20:16.457
No, no, I should go

217
00:20:18.041 --> 00:20:20.374
Who built this pavilion? It's so rickety

218
00:20:20.875 --> 00:20:22.665
Well, I think it's very nice

219
00:20:23.333 --> 00:20:25.790
And it's a perfect spot to see the West Lake

220
00:20:26.541 --> 00:20:28.040
I'm afraid I'm not so interested

221
00:20:28.333 --> 00:20:29.540
And I need to get home

222
00:20:30.375 --> 00:20:31.499
This early?

223
00:20:32.458 --> 00:20:36.457
There's moonlight on the lake,
a pavilion in the moonlight...

224
00:20:36.875 --> 00:20:39.165
And we're in the pavilion

225
00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:42.040
Don't you think it's romantic?

226
00:20:43.875 --> 00:20:45.040
I'm too busy for romance

227
00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:47.290
What are you avoiding?

228
00:20:48.541 --> 00:20:49.999
Why are you keeping such a distance from me?

229
00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.999
Why don't you like me?

230
00:20:53.916 --> 00:20:54.957
It's not that I don't like you, Miss

231
00:20:56.458 --> 00:20:59.957
But someone else already has my heart

232
00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:11.915
Miss, I'm a very poor man

233
00:21:12.916 --> 00:21:14.082
I pick herbs for a living

234
00:21:15.083 --> 00:21:16.915
I'm not worthy of your affections

235
00:21:19.208 --> 00:21:20.332
then tell me about her

236
00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.457
What kind of person is she?

237
00:21:26.916 --> 00:21:29.624
I know almost nothing about her

238
00:21:32.083 --> 00:21:36.457
I can't even recall her face

239
00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:41.665
All I know is that she saved my life

240
00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:47.624
That day I fell into a lake in the mountains

241
00:21:48.625 --> 00:21:49.999
She rescued me

242
00:21:55.916 --> 00:21:59.457
if she saved your life, you owe her a lot

243
00:22:01.083 --> 00:22:02.665
But when I revived...

244
00:22:03.958 --> 00:22:05.415
...she was gone

245
00:22:06.375 --> 00:22:08.249
My friends said I'd imagined her

246
00:22:09.416 --> 00:22:10.665
But I'm quite sure...

247
00:22:11.750 --> 00:22:13.124
...she was real

248
00:22:14.208 --> 00:22:18.499
Because she kissed me so deeply

249
00:22:19.458 --> 00:22:22.499
That kiss saved my life

250
00:22:25.166 --> 00:22:26.832
In a way, it also took my life

251
00:22:30.208 --> 00:22:31.249
What if...

252
00:22:31.625 --> 00:22:33.499
You could kiss her again?

253
00:22:34.916 --> 00:22:36.290
Would you remember her this time?

254
00:23:59.375 --> 00:24:01.207
Hello, my friend!

255
00:24:01.458 --> 00:24:03.832
Oh, it's you... haven't gone home yet?

256
00:24:04.000 --> 00:24:04.874
Done with your errands?

257
00:24:05.375 --> 00:24:06.415
All done

258
00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:08.749
It's dangerous here, you should go home

259
00:24:09.791 --> 00:24:12.207
if it's so dangerous, you should leave too

260
00:24:12.708 --> 00:24:14.374
I can't, I'm hunting demons

261
00:24:15.375 --> 00:24:16.415
Know the saying?

262
00:24:16.625 --> 00:24:19.540
"There's someone smarter than you know"

263
00:24:20.458 --> 00:24:23.665
It applies to demons too

264
00:24:24.416 --> 00:24:26.124
You're no match for this one

265
00:24:26.541 --> 00:24:28.749
I advise you to give up

266
00:24:30.833 --> 00:24:32.707
I can't, I'm sworn to obey my Master

267
00:24:32.916 --> 00:24:34.749
We have to trap the bat-demon tonight

268
00:24:36.166 --> 00:24:38.957
Well, if you want to kill yourself...

269
00:24:43.875 --> 00:24:45.790
This is a very, very powerful demon

270
00:24:49.250 --> 00:24:50.165
Not really...

271
00:24:50.500 --> 00:24:54.040
Just a bat-demon which bit a girl

272
00:24:54.750 --> 00:24:56.332
Ugh, she's all bloody!

273
00:24:56.625 --> 00:24:57.582
How do you know?

274
00:24:58.166 --> 00:25:00.374
I'm an expert too

275
00:25:06.291 --> 00:25:08.290
I can't let it get away

276
00:25:08.791 --> 00:25:10.957
Sorry we can't talk more, until next time!

277
00:25:12.083 --> 00:25:12.957
No!

278
00:25:14.125 --> 00:25:14.915
Watch out

279
00:25:15.791 --> 00:25:18.374
Oh well, there goes another friend

280
00:25:21.916 --> 00:25:23.415
Neng Ren of Jinshan Temple!

281
00:25:23.875 --> 00:25:25.874
Demon hunter and enforcer of Buddha's law

282
00:25:28.333 --> 00:25:29.832
No bluffing!

283
00:26:34.875 --> 00:26:50.832
Master! Save me!

284
00:26:56.875 --> 00:27:07.499
Master!

285
00:29:09.625 --> 00:29:10.582
Look!

286
00:29:10.791 --> 00:29:12.957
Master Fahai and Neng Ren are back

287
00:29:15.583 --> 00:29:16.582
What's wrong with Brother Neng Ren?

288
00:29:16.791 --> 00:29:18.165
The bat-demon poisoned him

289
00:29:18.583 --> 00:29:19.582
Can he be cured?

290
00:29:20.875 --> 00:29:22.207
if he's lucky...

291
00:29:40.958 --> 00:29:43.124
What are you staring at?

292
00:29:44.291 --> 00:29:45.374
You

293
00:29:46.541 --> 00:29:48.082
No need to keep staring so long

294
00:29:49.708 --> 00:29:51.165
I can't stop wondering...

295
00:29:51.791 --> 00:29:53.332
...if this is really happening

296
00:29:55.708 --> 00:29:56.874
What do you think?

297
00:29:58.625 --> 00:29:59.582
That you're dreaming?

298
00:30:02.500 --> 00:30:03.832
Someone once told me...

299
00:30:04.583 --> 00:30:07.499
if I want to see someone,
I should keep her in my heart

300
00:30:07.875 --> 00:30:09.124
then I'll really see her again

301
00:30:10.708 --> 00:30:13.957
Now I know it isn't superstition, it's true

302
00:30:20.916 --> 00:30:24.332
You're saying you did want to see me again?

303
00:30:29.583 --> 00:30:32.582
Xu Xian, let's go on like this

304
00:30:33.250 --> 00:30:34.624
Always together, alright?

305
00:30:35.666 --> 00:30:38.790
Eating together, sleeping together...

306
00:30:40.875 --> 00:30:42.082
Doing everything together

307
00:30:42.541 --> 00:30:43.665
Won't you get tired of me?

308
00:30:47.125 --> 00:30:48.165
Won't you?

309
00:30:52.833 --> 00:30:54.332
But I want to take you seriously

310
00:30:54.916 --> 00:30:57.374
I want to meet your parents

311
00:30:58.000 --> 00:31:00.624
And when I have their permission to court you...

312
00:31:02.166 --> 00:31:05.957
then we'll have a formal match and get married?

313
00:31:21.916 --> 00:31:24.124
Brother! Brother!

314
00:31:24.333 --> 00:31:25.249
Wake up!

315
00:31:25.416 --> 00:31:27.249
The sun rose hours ago!

316
00:31:27.291 --> 00:31:29.290
Brother, wake up!

317
00:31:29.875 --> 00:31:30.707
What?

318
00:31:30.916 --> 00:31:32.749
That's scary, Brother!

319
00:31:34.208 --> 00:31:36.665
Brother! You... Your ears have grown pointy!

320
00:31:37.125 --> 00:31:39.332
And you got fangs! So scary!

321
00:31:39.541 --> 00:31:42.374
Brother, are you turning into a demon?

322
00:31:58.166 --> 00:32:00.749
Master! Master! Something very bad has happened!

323
00:32:00.833 --> 00:32:02.249
Brother Neng Ren has run away

324
00:32:02.291 --> 00:32:04.915
Come and see! Quickly!

325
00:32:13.916 --> 00:32:16.832
This place isn't bad, we could live here

326
00:32:17.708 --> 00:32:18.540
Change!

327
00:32:25.166 --> 00:32:26.790
Hey, friend...

328
00:32:28.916 --> 00:32:29.915
You want to hang yourself?

329
00:32:30.791 --> 00:32:33.124
Hurry away, friend

330
00:32:33.791 --> 00:32:35.832
Death by hanging is an ugly sight

331
00:32:36.375 --> 00:32:37.749
You'll get nightmares

332
00:32:38.875 --> 00:32:39.915
I know!

333
00:32:40.583 --> 00:32:43.374
After death, your body turns purple

334
00:32:43.583 --> 00:32:46.290
Your tongue hangs loose and your eyes fall out!

335
00:32:46.541 --> 00:32:47.124
What?

336
00:32:47.583 --> 00:32:49.374
if you don't believe me, give it a go!

337
00:33:00.041 --> 00:33:02.374
You don't look like you really want to die

338
00:33:04.000 --> 00:33:05.582
You don't understand

339
00:33:05.916 --> 00:33:07.624
I'm a demon hunter...

340
00:33:08.166 --> 00:33:10.374
But I'm turning into a demon!

341
00:33:11.625 --> 00:33:12.499
Just think...

342
00:33:12.916 --> 00:33:15.874
When I meet a demon I've hunted before...

343
00:33:16.208 --> 00:33:17.874
... I'll seriously lose face

344
00:33:20.750 --> 00:33:22.290
if you're a demon, just be a demon

345
00:33:22.750 --> 00:33:23.749
When one demon meets another...

346
00:33:23.916 --> 00:33:25.457
Mostly they just nod a greeting

347
00:33:26.291 --> 00:33:29.374
And lots of them don't have limbs

348
00:33:29.541 --> 00:33:31.040
Who'll care about your face?

349
00:33:32.916 --> 00:33:34.374
I'll let you in on a secret

350
00:33:35.833 --> 00:33:38.957
Actually, I'm a demon too

351
00:33:43.625 --> 00:33:45.124
You... you...

352
00:33:45.250 --> 00:33:46.165
What's wrong?

353
00:33:47.166 --> 00:33:49.207
Aren't we two the same now?

354
00:33:50.791 --> 00:33:53.207
All demons together! Don't look at me like that

355
00:33:54.916 --> 00:33:56.957
Since we're so close now...

356
00:33:57.500 --> 00:34:00.290
... I'll teach you how to be a demon

357
00:34:01.041 --> 00:34:01.832
Come on!

358
00:34:02.083 --> 00:34:03.165
I'm gelded!

359
00:34:04.500 --> 00:34:05.207
Come on!

360
00:34:05.583 --> 00:34:06.457
A gelding!

361
00:34:06.625 --> 00:34:07.415
Come on!

362
00:34:08.500 --> 00:34:11.957
I just had chive for breakfast.
I am going to throw up!

363
00:34:12.041 --> 00:34:14.374
Bats hang upside-down, get used to it!

364
00:34:14.958 --> 00:34:18.832
My head will burst! It's full of blood!

365
00:34:19.583 --> 00:34:21.749
That will make you smarter

366
00:34:22.000 --> 00:34:23.249
I have a question for you...

367
00:34:23.375 --> 00:34:24.915
Am I pretty?

368
00:34:25.833 --> 00:34:26.832
Listen...

369
00:34:27.333 --> 00:34:29.082
Right now, all I can see is stars

370
00:34:29.541 --> 00:34:32.290
I'm seeing you upside-down

371
00:34:32.583 --> 00:34:34.082
Pretty doesn't come into it

372
00:34:34.375 --> 00:34:35.707
I see

373
00:34:42.958 --> 00:34:44.707
And now, am I pretty?

374
00:34:45.166 --> 00:34:48.040
Seeing you now... very pretty

375
00:34:50.208 --> 00:34:54.499
So, do you get a special feeling
when you look at me?

376
00:34:59.166 --> 00:35:02.499
Would you like to bite my neck?

377
00:35:03.000 --> 00:35:04.915
Taste my blood?

378
00:35:12.041 --> 00:35:13.082
Amitabha...

379
00:35:13.375 --> 00:35:14.915
I'm a sinner, I'm a sinner

380
00:35:14.958 --> 00:35:15.790
Drink some water

381
00:35:24.083 --> 00:35:25.665
What is this?

382
00:35:26.000 --> 00:35:26.957
What do you think?

383
00:35:29.166 --> 00:35:29.957
You bit my neck...

384
00:35:30.083 --> 00:35:31.374
...ate meat and drank blood!

385
00:35:31.500 --> 00:35:32.540
You violated the Three Taboos!

386
00:35:32.666 --> 00:35:34.374
No more calling yourself a monk!

387
00:35:34.833 --> 00:35:36.749
From now on, be the demon you are!

388
00:35:40.750 --> 00:35:43.457
Liar!

389
00:35:47.583 --> 00:35:49.332
We're there. Have we brought enough gifts?

390
00:35:50.166 --> 00:35:52.124
Stop worrying! Come on in

391
00:35:55.916 --> 00:35:58.124
I didn't expect your family to live in a mansion!

392
00:35:58.958 --> 00:36:00.332
It's just a broken-down old house

393
00:36:01.291 --> 00:36:03.915
You're here at last! You kept us waiting!

394
00:36:06.291 --> 00:36:08.457
They're all here... this is my family

395
00:36:09.583 --> 00:36:10.457
Go on in

396
00:36:11.291 --> 00:36:12.457
- Go ahead
- Thanks

397
00:36:14.250 --> 00:36:15.665
We need to hurry

398
00:36:15.875 --> 00:36:17.832
They can't keep these forms for long

399
00:36:19.250 --> 00:36:19.957
I know

400
00:36:20.333 --> 00:36:22.457
I want to play too!

401
00:36:22.708 --> 00:36:24.624
You can't take human form! Scram!

402
00:36:35.541 --> 00:36:36.457
Hello, everyone

403
00:36:39.875 --> 00:36:41.374
I'll make the introductions

404
00:36:43.500 --> 00:36:45.249
This is my father

405
00:36:46.000 --> 00:36:48.499
Hello

406
00:36:49.000 --> 00:36:49.832
Sir, my name is Xu Xian

407
00:36:53.333 --> 00:36:55.540
He's...

408
00:36:55.833 --> 00:36:58.040
He's absolutely amazing!

409
00:36:58.333 --> 00:36:59.540
You're...

410
00:36:59.583 --> 00:37:01.207
You're just perfect for each other!

411
00:37:01.541 --> 00:37:02.665
The perfect couple!

412
00:37:03.083 --> 00:37:03.915
Really...

413
00:37:04.875 --> 00:37:06.582
Really nice to see!

414
00:37:06.916 --> 00:37:09.124
How wonderful that you are here to propose!

415
00:37:10.083 --> 00:37:11.082
Don't worry, he's fine

416
00:37:11.291 --> 00:37:13.249
Auspicious day for an engagement, isn't it?

417
00:37:16.208 --> 00:37:18.332
This is... my mother

418
00:37:19.125 --> 00:37:19.707
She's so young!

419
00:37:20.083 --> 00:37:20.999
Really?

420
00:37:22.500 --> 00:37:23.624
Actually, my stepmother

421
00:37:26.625 --> 00:37:27.540
I'll introduce you

422
00:37:27.708 --> 00:37:30.374
Googie... Googie...

423
00:37:32.041 --> 00:37:35.040
How come you have a girl's name?

424
00:37:35.875 --> 00:37:38.040
You misheard, it's Gugu

425
00:37:38.625 --> 00:37:41.207
He was a chubby kid, that was his nickname

426
00:37:41.583 --> 00:37:43.165
And it stuck

427
00:37:46.208 --> 00:37:46.749
Hello, Gugu

428
00:37:46.958 --> 00:37:47.874
Let's sit down

429
00:37:51.500 --> 00:37:54.040
It's this year's latest fashion!

430
00:38:02.333 --> 00:38:05.624
This is called Doodle-do Wine

431
00:38:05.916 --> 00:38:07.457
It'll make you hiccup! Doodle-do!

432
00:38:12.833 --> 00:38:14.665
My parents like you to look at them when you speak

433
00:38:15.958 --> 00:38:16.707
Uh...

434
00:38:17.666 --> 00:38:19.249
Aren't you here today to propose?

435
00:38:19.416 --> 00:38:21.749
Hurry, then, we can hardly wait

436
00:38:28.833 --> 00:38:31.874
I am Xu Xian, poor and humble

437
00:38:32.875 --> 00:38:35.457
I never dreamt I'd win anyone like your Susu

438
00:38:42.916 --> 00:38:44.082
I've come here today...

439
00:38:44.500 --> 00:38:46.540
...because I seek your exalted permission...

440
00:38:48.083 --> 00:38:49.665
...to marry Susu

441
00:38:50.750 --> 00:38:51.624
Sir...

442
00:38:52.083 --> 00:38:53.332
Although I have nothing to my name...

443
00:38:55.250 --> 00:38:56.999
... I love Susu very much

444
00:38:58.708 --> 00:39:01.749
No need for a dowry, just take her home! Go on!

445
00:39:01.833 --> 00:39:04.249
I also want to say to Susu...

446
00:39:05.208 --> 00:39:06.290
Good heavens!

447
00:39:08.041 --> 00:39:09.749
Fine, just get on with it!

448
00:39:11.125 --> 00:39:12.915
I want to hear what Xu Xian has to say

449
00:39:13.250 --> 00:39:14.249
Sister...

450
00:39:18.916 --> 00:39:19.790
Speak

451
00:39:21.750 --> 00:39:22.915
I don't know what stroke of good fortune...

452
00:39:24.125 --> 00:39:25.624
...allows me to make you mine

453
00:39:26.708 --> 00:39:28.124
All it took was one kiss

454
00:39:28.875 --> 00:39:30.457
The wheels of fate turned...

455
00:39:31.125 --> 00:39:32.499
...and brought me to a perfect moment...

456
00:39:33.458 --> 00:39:35.624
...of tenderness and happiness

457
00:39:36.625 --> 00:39:38.832
From now on every moment, every second I have...

458
00:39:40.375 --> 00:39:41.624
... I will spend...

459
00:39:42.708 --> 00:39:43.832
...beside you

460
00:39:45.375 --> 00:39:47.040
To make you happy

461
00:39:54.958 --> 00:39:55.707
Why did you do that?

462
00:39:55.958 --> 00:39:57.707
They're reverting to their true forms

463
00:40:05.000 --> 00:40:06.082
It's bad! It's bad!

464
00:40:06.208 --> 00:40:08.499
Fahai is here to exorcise us! Run!

465
00:40:09.833 --> 00:40:10.707
Run!

466
00:40:13.166 --> 00:40:14.999
Get Xu Xian away from here while I distract him

467
00:40:15.291 --> 00:40:16.207
Take care!

468
00:40:18.875 --> 00:40:22.582
A tawdry illusion to dupe humans!

469
00:40:29.291 --> 00:40:30.499
Send them all back to the demon realm!

470
00:40:30.791 --> 00:40:31.499
Yes, Master!

471
00:41:47.791 --> 00:41:48.457
Master!

472
00:41:51.583 --> 00:41:54.165
Master, let her go!

473
00:41:55.958 --> 00:41:57.290
You know what you're asking?

474
00:41:58.583 --> 00:41:59.415
Come back with me

475
00:42:00.041 --> 00:42:00.999
Master...

476
00:42:04.041 --> 00:42:05.415
I can't go back any more

477
00:42:16.541 --> 00:42:18.290
Master, take care!

478
00:42:59.791 --> 00:43:00.874
We escaped?

479
00:43:02.333 --> 00:43:03.540
I'm not dead?

480
00:43:04.166 --> 00:43:06.332
Be calm, I'll always protect you

481
00:43:35.416 --> 00:43:36.499
What are we doing here?

482
00:43:37.541 --> 00:43:39.082
Weren't we getting engaged?

483
00:43:39.458 --> 00:43:40.374
We did it

484
00:43:41.125 --> 00:43:43.374
My parents gave us their blessing

485
00:43:44.541 --> 00:43:45.415
Really?

486
00:43:46.833 --> 00:43:47.624
That was easy

487
00:43:48.166 --> 00:43:49.290
So now we're married

488
00:43:50.333 --> 00:43:51.999
I'm your wife

489
00:43:52.916 --> 00:43:54.582
We can be together for the rest of our lives

490
00:43:57.958 --> 00:43:58.874
One day...

491
00:44:00.458 --> 00:44:01.707
... I'll have my own pharmacy

492
00:44:02.458 --> 00:44:03.540
then I'll have more money

493
00:44:05.958 --> 00:44:07.415
I don't want you to suffer with me

494
00:44:09.750 --> 00:44:10.707
How could that be?

495
00:44:12.166 --> 00:44:13.582
As long as we're together...

496
00:44:14.166 --> 00:44:15.624
... I'll never know suffering

497
00:44:56.125 --> 00:44:59.207
What's love like in this human world?

498
00:44:59.833 --> 00:45:00.749
What do you mean?

499
00:45:02.541 --> 00:45:04.999
I'd just like to know what kind of couple we are

500
00:45:06.083 --> 00:45:06.999
Tell me

501
00:45:08.458 --> 00:45:10.457
Well, there are several kinds...

502
00:45:12.666 --> 00:45:13.957
Some couples are like birds in the forest

503
00:45:14.500 --> 00:45:15.874
Each can fly away if they want

504
00:45:16.708 --> 00:45:17.707
Not that kind!

505
00:45:18.833 --> 00:45:19.624
Another kind is...

506
00:45:20.708 --> 00:45:21.624
...where the husband gets rich and dreams...

507
00:45:21.750 --> 00:45:22.999
...of his wife's death

508
00:45:23.375 --> 00:45:23.957
Xu Xian!

509
00:45:24.083 --> 00:45:24.957
I'll kill you!

510
00:45:27.125 --> 00:45:28.165
Watch out!

511
00:45:29.583 --> 00:45:30.957
Don't chase me!

512
00:45:31.375 --> 00:45:33.165
You'll make me drop the herbs!

513
00:45:33.250 --> 00:45:33.999
I'll kill you!

514
00:45:34.041 --> 00:45:35.415
I'll kill you! I'll kill you!

515
00:46:44.416 --> 00:46:46.249
This disease cannot be cured

516
00:46:48.083 --> 00:46:48.582
Master

517
00:46:48.625 --> 00:46:49.999
They are victims of demons

518
00:46:50.458 --> 00:46:55.165
At best, they'll go mad... at worst, they'll die

519
00:46:56.666 --> 00:46:59.499
while they're alive, I must try to save them

520
00:47:02.250 --> 00:47:05.665
Take precautions, don't go to strange places alone

521
00:47:06.375 --> 00:47:07.499
Thank you, Master

522
00:47:11.208 --> 00:47:12.582
Where did this disease come from?

523
00:47:12.958 --> 00:47:14.249
So many people suddenly dying

524
00:47:14.958 --> 00:47:16.082
You should take some rest

525
00:47:16.708 --> 00:47:18.332
You've been making medicine for three days!

526
00:47:18.625 --> 00:47:19.249
I can't

527
00:47:20.333 --> 00:47:23.707
I have to find the cure

528
00:47:24.958 --> 00:47:26.540
Susu, give me a hand

529
00:47:27.708 --> 00:47:28.624
It mustn't stick...

530
00:47:29.041 --> 00:47:29.874
...to the bottom of the pot

531
00:47:34.333 --> 00:47:35.207
Preserving vital essence

532
00:47:35.708 --> 00:47:36.415
concentrating vigor

533
00:47:37.041 --> 00:47:37.790
boosting the spirit

534
00:47:38.500 --> 00:47:39.832
Aside from these fundamentals...

535
00:47:40.333 --> 00:47:42.290
...the medicine must strengthen basic functions

536
00:47:44.833 --> 00:47:46.165
This is such a fierce disease

537
00:47:46.875 --> 00:47:48.124
Can this medicine work?

538
00:47:48.541 --> 00:47:49.749
I don't really know

539
00:47:55.958 --> 00:47:58.624
Woman...

540
00:48:44.250 --> 00:48:44.999
Disciples!

541
00:49:21.083 --> 00:49:23.874
Foul demons! Crossing the three realms
and five planes...

542
00:49:24.333 --> 00:49:27.207
...you've harmed the people
and spread chaos and evil!

543
00:49:27.666 --> 00:49:30.374
By Buddha's mercy, if you choose to repent...

544
00:49:30.875 --> 00:49:32.415
...you still have a chance to live

545
00:49:33.125 --> 00:49:36.165
We'd rather die than listen to your nonsense!

546
00:50:06.333 --> 00:50:07.957
Beware! The fox-demons are casting a charm!

547
00:50:08.500 --> 00:50:09.082
On guard!

548
00:50:09.375 --> 00:50:10.165
Yes, Master!

549
00:50:13.500 --> 00:50:14.874
Maximum protection shield!

550
00:50:16.083 --> 00:50:18.415
Heaven needs no hearing, ecstasy needs no sight

551
00:50:19.000 --> 00:50:20.332
void my sense of self

552
00:51:03.708 --> 00:51:05.832
What's that mantra?

553
00:51:06.041 --> 00:51:09.457
Is it real or are you making it up?

554
00:51:20.583 --> 00:51:21.749
Show your real forms!

555
00:51:49.166 --> 00:51:50.957
By heaven's mercy

556
00:51:51.250 --> 00:51:53.249
Master, we regret our sin

557
00:51:53.416 --> 00:51:55.915
Please let us go. We beg you

558
00:51:56.041 --> 00:51:57.707
Silence! You are demons!

559
00:51:58.125 --> 00:51:59.749
return to the six paths of transmigration!

560
00:52:00.125 --> 00:52:01.749
Accept your punishment with humility!

561
00:52:03.583 --> 00:52:04.874
Amitabha...

562
00:52:19.625 --> 00:52:21.624
Sister, Sister

563
00:52:22.041 --> 00:52:24.207
What's wrong? Are you alright?

564
00:52:27.041 --> 00:52:27.749
It's nothing

565
00:52:28.208 --> 00:52:29.415
That's impossible...

566
00:52:29.750 --> 00:52:31.499
if you keep on like this...

567
00:52:31.666 --> 00:52:34.290
...something will go very wrong

568
00:52:35.500 --> 00:52:36.207
I know what I'm doing

569
00:52:36.500 --> 00:52:38.374
All you care about is that Xu Xian

570
00:52:38.625 --> 00:52:40.582
Adding your vital essence to that medicine...

571
00:52:40.625 --> 00:52:43.999
...is costing you centuries of self-improvement

572
00:52:44.166 --> 00:52:45.749
I don't want to see him work so hard

573
00:52:46.500 --> 00:52:47.207
I want to help him

574
00:52:47.416 --> 00:52:51.040
But you may not live to see him again!

575
00:52:51.458 --> 00:52:52.540
It can't be that bad

576
00:52:52.875 --> 00:52:54.124
Of course it is

577
00:52:54.541 --> 00:52:55.290
I have to go

578
00:52:57.708 --> 00:53:00.582
Wait!

579
00:53:01.416 --> 00:53:02.832
Ah, Dr Xu is here

580
00:53:03.041 --> 00:53:04.499
Dr Xu, thank you!

581
00:53:05.041 --> 00:53:07.290
You're truly our savior

582
00:53:08.333 --> 00:53:10.165
We owe you our lives

583
00:53:10.208 --> 00:53:11.957
You and your wife are such good people

584
00:53:14.125 --> 00:53:15.457
Don't rush

585
00:53:16.125 --> 00:53:18.665
There's enough for everyone

586
00:53:19.541 --> 00:53:20.332
Thank you

587
00:53:21.375 --> 00:53:23.165
Master, you should take some too

588
00:53:23.291 --> 00:53:25.332
It cures sickness and prevents infection

589
00:53:32.541 --> 00:53:33.915
Thank you

590
00:53:34.000 --> 00:53:34.624
Master...

591
00:53:34.916 --> 00:53:36.249
Did you mix this medicine?

592
00:53:36.500 --> 00:53:37.249
Yes

593
00:53:37.791 --> 00:53:38.499
No-one helped you?

594
00:53:38.583 --> 00:53:40.082
Yes, my wife did

595
00:53:41.583 --> 00:53:43.249
You are the quintessence of benevolence

596
00:53:44.250 --> 00:53:47.207
Take this spirit dagger as a token of thanks

597
00:53:47.750 --> 00:53:49.707
I can't, Master, I'm just doing my duty

598
00:53:49.791 --> 00:53:51.374
You shouldn't refuse a gift from a senior

599
00:53:51.750 --> 00:53:53.165
Keep it to protect yourself

600
00:53:55.458 --> 00:53:56.415
Thank you, Master

601
00:53:57.833 --> 00:53:58.999
Amitabha...

602
00:54:29.666 --> 00:54:31.207
You think you can run?

603
00:55:28.333 --> 00:55:31.124
You made the cure for the fox-demon's poison

604
00:55:31.500 --> 00:55:32.457
So what?

605
00:55:34.291 --> 00:55:36.082
Making it has cost you centuries
of your vital essence

606
00:55:36.625 --> 00:55:39.624
You're kind to the ordinary people

607
00:55:40.583 --> 00:55:43.832
But in your eyes, all we do is harm people

608
00:55:44.125 --> 00:55:46.582
Despite good intentions, you will harm someone

609
00:55:46.750 --> 00:55:47.499
Who will I harm?

610
00:55:47.833 --> 00:55:48.999
You should know that

611
00:55:49.666 --> 00:55:52.207
Xu Xian is my true love, how could I harm him?

612
00:55:52.458 --> 00:55:54.749
You're from different realms! Being together...

613
00:55:55.000 --> 00:55:57.165
...you drain his life-force and distort his destiny

614
00:55:57.500 --> 00:56:00.332
Human lives are short, and true love is rare

615
00:56:00.583 --> 00:56:02.624
He didn't choose to love you, you took his love

616
00:56:03.000 --> 00:56:05.749
What does that matter? He's happy with me

617
00:56:06.666 --> 00:56:08.124
Go chant your sutras!

618
00:56:08.791 --> 00:56:10.832
You know nothing of love

619
00:56:12.875 --> 00:56:14.749
if Xu Xian knew you are a snake...

620
00:56:15.041 --> 00:56:16.499
...would he still love you?

621
00:56:21.916 --> 00:56:23.415
I truly love him

622
00:56:27.833 --> 00:56:28.999
if that's the case, shed your own tears

623
00:56:29.166 --> 00:56:32.165
Don't make him shed tears over you

624
00:56:38.583 --> 00:56:39.957
Since you're so benevolent...

625
00:56:40.666 --> 00:56:42.165
... I'll let you go this time

626
00:56:43.750 --> 00:56:46.540
if I see you again in this realm,
there'll be no mercy

627
00:57:10.583 --> 00:57:11.874
Susu, I'm home

628
00:57:12.208 --> 00:57:14.457
So soon?

629
00:57:17.458 --> 00:57:18.207
You're back...

630
00:57:18.750 --> 00:57:19.707
Look!

631
00:57:21.458 --> 00:57:22.832
What's special about today?

632
00:57:23.125 --> 00:57:24.082
Well, everyone else...

633
00:57:25.208 --> 00:57:26.457
...is celebrating the Dragon Boat Festival

634
00:57:26.583 --> 00:57:27.374
while I am celebrating...

635
00:57:27.708 --> 00:57:29.457
...the best day I've ever had!

636
00:57:29.958 --> 00:57:33.082
The day my medicine cured everyone!

637
00:57:33.875 --> 00:57:34.540
Really?

638
00:57:35.833 --> 00:57:36.749
That's wonderful

639
00:57:37.875 --> 00:57:39.540
The old villagers were so grateful

640
00:57:39.875 --> 00:57:41.124
They gave us all this food

641
00:57:41.583 --> 00:57:43.999
Susu, thank you for working so hard

642
00:57:44.708 --> 00:57:46.999
Here, a toast to you

643
00:57:55.583 --> 00:57:56.290
I'm hungry

644
00:57:56.666 --> 00:57:57.665
Here, try this

645
00:58:03.250 --> 00:58:04.457
It's good

646
00:58:06.416 --> 00:58:07.249
You have some too

647
00:58:10.958 --> 00:58:11.790
What's wrong?

648
00:58:15.500 --> 00:58:16.499
What kind of wine is this?

649
00:58:17.041 --> 00:58:18.290
They distilled it themselves

650
00:58:21.541 --> 00:58:22.249
Sulphur-flower wine!

651
00:58:22.875 --> 00:58:23.499
That's right

652
00:58:24.083 --> 00:58:27.374
It's a festival tradition, it wards off snake-bites

653
00:58:29.916 --> 00:58:30.457
Susu?

654
00:58:32.458 --> 00:58:34.374
Susu? What's wrong? Susu!

655
00:58:35.833 --> 00:58:38.457
Susu? Susu? What's the matter?

656
00:58:38.625 --> 00:58:39.582
Are you alright?

657
00:58:40.416 --> 00:58:41.290
I'm alright

658
00:58:42.166 --> 00:58:42.749
Susu!

659
00:58:44.208 --> 00:58:46.207
Why lock the door? Open it!

660
00:58:47.416 --> 00:58:48.207
Susu...

661
00:58:48.291 --> 00:58:49.124
Don't frighten me!

662
00:58:50.500 --> 00:58:51.207
Susu...

663
00:58:53.958 --> 00:58:55.040
What's the matter?

664
00:58:55.875 --> 00:59:12.957
Susu!

665
00:59:14.166 --> 00:59:16.165
Susu, what are you doing?

666
00:59:16.583 --> 00:59:17.415
Open the door!

667
00:59:18.666 --> 00:59:20.749
Susu, don't frighten me

668
00:59:22.666 --> 00:59:23.457
Xu Xian...

669
00:59:24.166 --> 00:59:25.332
Do you recall...

670
00:59:25.916 --> 00:59:27.832
...what you said to me when you proposed?

671
00:59:28.791 --> 00:59:30.165
I want to hear you say it again

672
00:59:32.125 --> 00:59:33.540
I knew you were playing a trick on me!

673
00:59:34.958 --> 00:59:35.832
I'd rather not repeat it

674
00:59:37.041 --> 00:59:37.957
if you don't...

675
00:59:39.083 --> 00:59:40.415
... I might never hear it again

676
00:59:40.708 --> 00:59:41.665
Alright, alright

677
00:59:42.416 --> 00:59:43.249
I'll say it

678
00:59:44.166 --> 00:59:46.957
But then you must open the door!

679
00:59:47.666 --> 00:59:50.915
Alright

680
00:59:54.583 --> 00:59:55.957
"All it took was one kiss"

681
00:59:57.166 --> 00:59:59.290
"I'm sure that the wheels of fate turned..."

682
01:00:01.583 --> 01:00:03.124
"...and brought me to a perfect moment..."

683
01:00:04.458 --> 01:00:07.874
"...of tenderness and happiness"

684
01:00:10.625 --> 01:00:11.957
"From now on..."

685
01:00:13.458 --> 01:00:15.415
"...every moment, every second I have..."

686
01:00:16.166 --> 01:00:18.374
"... I will spend beside you..."

687
01:00:22.041 --> 01:00:23.832
"...to make you happy"

688
01:00:28.958 --> 01:00:31.457
Susu! Susu!

689
01:00:33.458 --> 01:00:34.624
Open the door, Susu!

690
01:00:41.541 --> 01:00:42.957
I gave you a chance

691
01:00:43.166 --> 01:00:45.207
You didn't leave, so now I must take you

692
01:00:45.333 --> 01:00:45.915
Monk...

693
01:00:46.458 --> 01:00:48.749
Why are you intent on destroying our happiness?

694
01:00:48.958 --> 01:00:50.790
Susu! Who are you talking to?

695
01:01:39.958 --> 01:01:40.790
Don't chase her

696
01:01:42.083 --> 01:01:42.915
She was stabbed with the spirit dagger

697
01:01:43.458 --> 01:01:46.165
Losing vital essence, she can't take human form

698
01:01:47.125 --> 01:01:49.832
Master, where is my wife?

699
01:01:51.583 --> 01:01:53.749
Did the white snake eat her?

700
01:01:54.083 --> 01:01:55.499
The white snake was your wife

701
01:01:56.125 --> 01:01:57.832
You married a thousand-year-old snake demon

702
01:02:03.125 --> 01:02:12.499
Impossible!

703
01:02:59.375 --> 01:03:02.249
Sister, I'll give you some of my vital essence

704
01:03:05.416 --> 01:03:06.415
It's no use

705
01:03:09.291 --> 01:03:12.749
You have only a few centuries' worth

706
01:03:13.583 --> 01:03:18.040
That spirit dagger had thousands!

707
01:03:22.833 --> 01:03:24.790
We were wrong to come here

708
01:03:26.416 --> 01:03:29.457
It wasn't worth it, to see you like this

709
01:03:35.416 --> 01:03:37.207
Maybe I shouldn't have done it...

710
01:03:41.000 --> 01:03:42.249
But I have no regrets

711
01:03:46.875 --> 01:03:48.040
Only now do I know...

712
01:03:49.666 --> 01:03:51.582
...what true love is

713
01:03:56.000 --> 01:03:57.040
Love...

714
01:03:58.041 --> 01:03:59.915
Is it really so important?

715
01:04:05.125 --> 01:04:06.207
Tell me...

716
01:04:07.083 --> 01:04:08.624
How can I save Susu?

717
01:04:10.750 --> 01:04:12.165
The one thing that might is spirit herb

718
01:04:12.333 --> 01:04:14.124
It can bring the dead back to life

719
01:04:16.000 --> 01:04:19.499
It only grows in the Lei Feng Pagoda

720
01:04:19.916 --> 01:04:22.290
A demon like me can't even get in there!

721
01:04:22.541 --> 01:04:25.374
Plus, there is only a single sprout

722
01:04:25.625 --> 01:04:29.290
It is really, really scary.
They say fire can't even burn it!

723
01:04:31.250 --> 01:04:32.957
Even if it takes braving swords and seas of fire...

724
01:04:35.666 --> 01:04:37.124
... I shall save Susu

725
01:04:51.916 --> 01:04:53.457
I can't take you any further

726
01:06:45.166 --> 01:06:49.790
You dare to steal the spirit herb? Thief!

727
01:07:06.083 --> 01:07:08.040
Which is the real spirit herb?

728
01:07:09.333 --> 01:07:11.332
You will know after your death

729
01:07:12.791 --> 01:07:15.290
I'll find it even if it kills me!

730
01:07:17.291 --> 01:07:19.499
I must save Susu!

731
01:07:28.750 --> 01:07:31.499
There's only a single sprout.
Fire can't even burn it!

732
01:09:03.750 --> 01:09:05.082
They found us!

733
01:09:15.250 --> 01:09:16.249
Did you get the spirit herb?

734
01:09:16.375 --> 01:09:16.790
I did

735
01:09:16.916 --> 01:09:17.624
then let's get out of here!

736
01:09:20.583 --> 01:09:22.082
It is going to be a disaster If they catch you

737
01:09:22.375 --> 01:09:24.457
You take the spirit herb, I'll distract them

738
01:09:56.583 --> 01:09:59.957
Demons have been confined in
Lei Feng Pagoda for aeons!

739
01:10:00.583 --> 01:10:02.165
The spirit herb kept them trapped

740
01:10:03.083 --> 01:10:05.832
Your theft has caused a catastrophe!

741
01:10:06.750 --> 01:10:09.457
Let me go! Why are you keeping me here?

742
01:10:10.083 --> 01:10:11.290
I needed it to save her!

743
01:10:11.750 --> 01:10:13.124
I wounded Susu

744
01:10:13.416 --> 01:10:16.457
Master, let me go! Let me go!

745
01:10:16.625 --> 01:10:17.832
I wounded Susu

746
01:10:21.666 --> 01:10:24.124
Master, we can't hold them much longer

747
01:10:24.791 --> 01:10:26.124
Call all the senior monks, now!

748
01:10:26.875 --> 01:10:28.457
We'll cast the Luohan spell!

749
01:10:36.500 --> 01:10:38.040
I got spirit herb!

750
01:10:41.708 --> 01:10:43.790
Spirit herb? From where?

751
01:10:44.375 --> 01:10:45.624
Xu Xian gave it to me

752
01:10:47.000 --> 01:10:47.790
Where is he?

753
01:10:49.541 --> 01:10:50.999
The monks took him

754
01:11:31.041 --> 01:11:31.874
Disciples!

755
01:11:32.333 --> 01:11:34.415
Seal the main hall with a maximum protection spell!

756
01:11:44.208 --> 01:11:45.457
Maximum protection in force!

757
01:11:46.583 --> 01:11:48.874
Now we cast the spell!

758
01:11:49.416 --> 01:11:51.415
Any interruption will kill him!

759
01:12:22.583 --> 01:12:25.165
Leave! You trespass on hallowed ground!

760
01:12:25.333 --> 01:12:27.082
Fahai, give me my Xu Xian!

761
01:12:27.458 --> 01:12:29.915
You should be thankful you aren't dead

762
01:12:30.250 --> 01:12:31.499
Why this further trouble?

763
01:12:31.958 --> 01:12:34.165
Release him and I'll go at once

764
01:12:34.625 --> 01:12:36.165
He stole the spirit herb for you

765
01:12:36.750 --> 01:12:38.957
He's in great danger
because evil spirits possessed him!

766
01:12:39.250 --> 01:12:41.249
Now we're breaking your spell!

767
01:12:42.125 --> 01:12:43.124
I possessed him?

768
01:12:43.250 --> 01:12:44.165
That cannot be...

769
01:12:44.791 --> 01:12:45.457
I want to see him

770
01:12:45.750 --> 01:12:47.124
He's in a life-or-death struggle

771
01:12:47.500 --> 01:12:48.665
Interrupting the ritual...

772
01:12:48.958 --> 01:12:50.332
...will end his life...

773
01:12:50.416 --> 01:12:52.165
...and threaten those around him

774
01:12:53.500 --> 01:12:56.332
Relations between humans and demons
can bring no good

775
01:12:56.625 --> 01:12:57.415
You...

776
01:12:58.000 --> 01:13:01.165
You're just coming between my sister and Xu Xian!

777
01:13:01.666 --> 01:13:04.957
if you won't release him, I'll fight you!

778
01:14:07.666 --> 01:14:10.332
if I don't leave with Xu Xian, I'll flood Jinshan!

779
01:14:10.708 --> 01:14:13.665
You are selfish! How many lives will you threaten?

780
01:14:14.500 --> 01:14:17.082
I will be forced to put an end to you
unless you stop

781
01:14:18.166 --> 01:14:20.499
Very well... You're forcing me!

782
01:15:42.458 --> 01:15:43.457
Get the important ones first.

783
01:15:45.666 --> 01:15:46.499
Quick!

784
01:18:30.291 --> 01:18:31.915
Forward, brothers!

785
01:18:32.458 --> 01:18:34.457
Charge!

786
01:18:39.500 --> 01:18:40.290
Bite them!

787
01:18:40.375 --> 01:18:41.832
Break their human chain!

788
01:19:23.166 --> 01:19:24.832
Xu Xian! Xu Xian!

789
01:19:44.000 --> 01:19:44.874
Xu Xian?

790
01:19:46.833 --> 01:19:47.665
You...

791
01:19:49.666 --> 01:19:50.665
It's me, Susu

792
01:19:52.000 --> 01:19:52.707
Susu?

793
01:19:58.958 --> 01:20:00.582
Who is Susu?

794
01:20:06.916 --> 01:20:08.582
I'm your wife

795
01:20:10.208 --> 01:20:11.915
When did I get married?

796
01:20:12.583 --> 01:20:14.582
Do you remember how we met?

797
01:20:17.375 --> 01:20:18.207
I...

798
01:20:23.708 --> 01:20:26.207
Fahai, what horrible magic did you use...

799
01:20:26.708 --> 01:20:27.957
...to make him forget me?

800
01:20:28.458 --> 01:20:30.749
As I told you, evil spirits possessed him

801
01:20:31.375 --> 01:20:33.874
You broke in and disrupted the Luohan spell!

802
01:20:34.458 --> 01:20:37.374
You're the one who's harmed Xu Xian!

803
01:20:38.041 --> 01:20:41.165
What Luohan spell? What possession?

804
01:20:41.791 --> 01:20:43.124
You're making it up!

805
01:20:44.166 --> 01:20:46.082
You just want Xu Xian to leave me

806
01:20:47.250 --> 01:20:48.332
You're a monster!

807
01:22:13.166 --> 01:22:13.915
Qingqing!

808
01:23:13.708 --> 01:23:25.582
Brother Neng Ren!

809
01:23:39.166 --> 01:23:40.582
I have been a dharma defender all my life...

810
01:23:41.333 --> 01:23:43.124
...to maintain natural order and ethical conduct

811
01:23:44.416 --> 01:23:47.957
Why did the calamity happen instead?

812
01:23:49.750 --> 01:23:51.415
Have I been too stubborn?

813
01:23:55.125 --> 01:23:56.332
Was I really wrong?

814
01:24:23.875 --> 01:24:24.999
Why is it...

815
01:24:27.833 --> 01:24:29.665
...that every time I wake up...

816
01:24:31.833 --> 01:24:33.624
...you're beside me?

817
01:27:59.916 --> 01:28:02.165
Open the door! Let me out!

818
01:28:02.916 --> 01:28:04.832
Let me see Xu Xian once more!

819
01:28:05.208 --> 01:28:08.665
I don't care if you turn me to dust and scatter me

820
01:28:20.083 --> 01:28:23.915
The love we had... was it not real?

821
01:28:27.708 --> 01:28:30.457
Where is all your 'great benevolence' now?

822
01:28:38.875 --> 01:28:40.540
Can't we see each other just once more?

823
01:28:46.541 --> 01:28:47.915
Just once...

824
01:28:57.375 --> 01:28:58.582
I'll accept my punishment

825
01:29:03.666 --> 01:29:05.582
Amitabha...

826
01:29:32.750 --> 01:29:33.999
Your mercy is boundless...

827
01:29:36.083 --> 01:29:37.457
I understand...

828
01:29:38.958 --> 01:29:40.290
Amitabha...

829
01:30:12.625 --> 01:30:13.624
Xu Xian!

830
01:30:17.666 --> 01:30:18.832
You're suffering...

831
01:30:20.708 --> 01:30:22.165
I don't recognize you...

832
01:30:24.375 --> 01:30:25.832
But for some reason I don't understand...

833
01:30:28.000 --> 01:30:29.665
...when I see you shedding tears...

834
01:30:31.708 --> 01:30:33.165
...my heart aches for you

835
01:30:39.208 --> 01:30:42.915
Don't be upset, I don't want you to cry

836
01:30:45.208 --> 01:30:46.707
I'll cry for both of us

837
01:30:48.666 --> 01:30:51.665
I don't mind that you've forgotten me

838
01:30:54.666 --> 01:30:56.249
My own memories are enough

839
01:30:57.708 --> 01:30:58.915
Before I first saw you...

840
01:31:00.666 --> 01:31:02.832
... I meditated for a thousand years

841
01:31:05.708 --> 01:31:07.124
But those thousand years...

842
01:31:09.250 --> 01:31:11.957
...were worth less than a moment with you

843
01:31:15.708 --> 01:31:16.790
You'll never know...

844
01:31:19.875 --> 01:31:23.207
...how I've had to suffer

845
01:31:24.916 --> 01:31:26.207
But even if I die...

846
01:31:28.708 --> 01:31:30.124
... I'll have no regrets

847
01:32:14.916 --> 01:32:17.082
Susu...

848
01:32:29.458 --> 01:32:32.540
"Your hair tickles my heart"

849
01:32:32.625 --> 01:32:35.957
"Your eyes lingers in my mind"

850
01:32:36.000 --> 01:32:39.624
"I can bear any hardships to be with you"

851
01:32:39.708 --> 01:32:44.124
"Our love shall remain in the dark"

852
01:32:44.541 --> 01:32:47.124
"year after year"

853
01:32:47.125 --> 01:32:48.790
"but nothing can change it"

854
01:32:48.833 --> 01:32:50.499
"Nothing at all"

855
01:32:50.625 --> 01:32:52.290
"I will be there"

856
01:32:52.333 --> 01:32:55.290
"if you are there"

857
01:32:55.625 --> 01:33:01.624
"I vow to live for you"

858
01:33:02.541 --> 01:33:08.540
"coz I can lose anything but you"

859
01:33:08.958 --> 01:33:11.540
"Love is right"

860
01:33:12.000 --> 01:33:15.707
"if there is joy between us"

861
01:33:15.833 --> 01:33:18.665
"Our love shall survive"

862
01:33:18.875 --> 01:33:22.832
"longer than any time"

863
01:33:23.083 --> 01:33:28.165
"I vow to live for you"

864
01:33:28.250 --> 01:33:29.999
"till the end of time"

865
01:33:30.041 --> 01:33:34.999
"coz I can lose anything but you"

866
01:33:35.083 --> 01:33:39.165
"Love is right"

867
01:33:39.375 --> 01:33:43.165
"if the tortures on me are to protect you"

868
01:33:43.208 --> 01:33:45.832
"Our love shall survive"

869
01:33:46.333 --> 01:33:50.915
"longer than any time"

870
01:33:51.375 --> 01:33:56.707
"And we'll meet again in our next lives"

871
01:34:00.875 --> 01:34:01.874
Susu...

872
01:34:11.625 --> 01:34:13.249
for the two of them...

873
01:34:14.041 --> 01:34:16.415
...that was probably the best outcome

874
01:34:19.416 --> 01:34:22.915
I never want to love anyone as she loved him

875
01:34:23.791 --> 01:34:27.540
You... you'll never be much good as a demon

876
01:35:28.500 --> 01:35:29.332
Neng Ren...

877
01:35:30.041 --> 01:35:31.332
That new form you have...

878
01:35:31.541 --> 01:35:32.790
It kind of suits you
